{
  "id": "A57",
  "goal": "INC04-S03A-R07-C2A",
  "title": "Research call evidence: a tracked model reservation's closed call binding and its settlement's private facts",
  "why": [
    "SOPHIA-INC-2026-11 INC-04 R07 C2A under root contracts R1 5c5f89ee and R2 c2dde9b6 with mandatory C01/C02 (migration 0109). Assigned to INC04-S03A-R07-C2A-001; the generated output is regenerated with `pnpm --filter @sophia/contracts generate`, never by hand.",
    "C01: a tracked reserve (mode tracked_v1 with its honest contract) is answered with a closed call binding the bridge compares with its exact request before any provider effect; a reply without it, or with another call's, refuses the call. A request without a mode is legacy and its reply is byte-identical.",
    "A tracked settlement carries closed facts: disjoint counts each known, unknown or no separate reported class, the consumer's ending, and the response id in its own namespace (1..8192 UTF-8 bytes of well-formed text, or omitted with a fixed reason). The service answers a bounded disposition and digest only. No header id, partial or provider-terminal carrier (C2B); no raw id in usage, providerRequestId, logs or errors.",
    "All four shapes stay closed (additionalProperties false); the new fields are optional, so the three reserve and three settle routes keep their legacy contract. The declared route is metadata only, never a price the service applies."
  ],
  "patch": [
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/components/schemas/ResearchReserveRequest/properties/mode",
      "value": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": ["tracked_v1"],
        "description": "A tracked model reservation (C2A). Without it the reservation is legacy and its reply is unchanged."
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/components/schemas/ResearchReserveRequest/properties/contract",
      "value": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": ["c1p_complete_report", "legacy_report"],
        "description": "The honest report contract of the call's loaded decoder: c1p_complete_report only for the qualified C1P Responses route; otherwise legacy_report."
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/components/schemas/ResearchReserveRequest/properties/declared",
      "value": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "The route the bridge meters the call on, as metadata only: never a price the service applies.",
        "properties": {
          "routeId": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^[a-z][a-z0-9-]{0,62}[a-z0-9]$"
          },
          "model": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9._:/-]{0,127}$"
          },
          "reasoningEffort": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string",
                "pattern": "^[a-z]{1,16}$"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ]
          },
          "prices": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "properties": {
              "input": {
                "type": "number",
                "minimum": 0,
                "maximum": 10000
              },
              "cacheRead": {
                "type": "number",
                "minimum": 0,
                "maximum": 10000
              },
              "cacheWrite": {
                "type": "number",
                "minimum": 0,
                "maximum": 10000
              },
              "output": {
                "type": "number",
                "minimum": 0,
                "maximum": 10000
              }
            },
            "required": ["input", "cacheRead", "cacheWrite", "output"]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/components/schemas/ResearchReservation/properties/binding",
      "value": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "A tracked reservation's closed call binding, from the authenticated rows: the bridge compares it with its exact request before the call leaves. No token, credential or provider id.",
        "properties": {
          "mode": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["tracked_v1"],
            "description": "The mode frozen at reserve."
          },
          "contract": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["c1p_complete_report", "legacy_report"]
          },
          "evidenceId": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{12}$"
          },
          "callId": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9._:-]{0,63}$"
          },
          "attemptId": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9_-]{0,63}$"
          },
          "nativeSessionId": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9._:-]{0,159}$"
          },
          "projectId": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9_-]{0,63}$"
          },
          "runtimeUnitId": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9._-]{0,159}$"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "mode",
          "contract",
          "evidenceId",
          "callId",
          "attemptId",
          "nativeSessionId",
          "projectId",
          "runtimeUnitId"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/components/schemas/ResearchSettleRequest/properties/evidence",
      "value": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "A tracked reservation's closed call facts (required for it, refused for a legacy one). Disjoint counts, each known, unknown or no separate reported class; the consumer's ending (the provider's terminal kind stays unknown); the response id in its own namespace, kept whole only when supported. The request header id is not carried.",
        "properties": {
          "contract": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["c1p_complete_report", "legacy_report"]
          },
          "report": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["complete_report", "not_complete", "legacy_usage"]
          },
          "counts": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "properties": {
              "nonCachedInput": {
                "description": "Input tokens not read from the cache.",
                "anyOf": [
                  {
                    "type": "object",
                    "additionalProperties": false,
                    "properties": {
                      "class": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "enum": ["known"]
                      },
                      "value": {
                        "type": "integer",
                        "minimum": 0,
                        "maximum": 9007199254740991
                      }
                    },
                    "required": ["class", "value"]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "object",
                    "additionalProperties": false,
                    "properties": {
                      "class": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "enum": ["unknown", "no_separate_reported_class"]
                      }
                    },
                    "required": ["class"]
                  }
                ]
              },
              "cacheRead": {
                "description": "Input tokens read from the cache.",
                "anyOf": [
                  {
                    "type": "object",
                    "additionalProperties": false,
                    "properties": {
                      "class": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "enum": ["known"]
                      },
                      "value": {
                        "type": "integer",
                        "minimum": 0,
                        "maximum": 9007199254740991
                      }
                    },
                    "required": ["class", "value"]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "object",
                    "additionalProperties": false,
                    "properties": {
                      "class": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "enum": ["unknown", "no_separate_reported_class"]
                      }
                    },
                    "required": ["class"]
                  }
                ]
              },
              "cacheWrite": {
                "description": "Tokens written to the cache, when the provider reports them as their own class.",
                "anyOf": [
                  {
                    "type": "object",
                    "additionalProperties": false,
                    "properties": {
                      "class": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "enum": ["known"]
                      },
                      "value": {
                        "type": "integer",
                        "minimum": 0,
                        "maximum": 9007199254740991
                      }
                    },
                    "required": ["class", "value"]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "object",
                    "additionalProperties": false,
                    "properties": {
                      "class": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "enum": ["unknown", "no_separate_reported_class"]
                      }
                    },
                    "required": ["class"]
                  }
                ]
              },
              "output": {
                "description": "Output tokens.",
                "anyOf": [
                  {
                    "type": "object",
                    "additionalProperties": false,
                    "properties": {
                      "class": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "enum": ["known"]
                      },
                      "value": {
                        "type": "integer",
                        "minimum": 0,
                        "maximum": 9007199254740991
                      }
                    },
                    "required": ["class", "value"]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "object",
                    "additionalProperties": false,
                    "properties": {
                      "class": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "enum": ["unknown", "no_separate_reported_class"]
                      }
                    },
                    "required": ["class"]
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            "required": ["nonCachedInput", "cacheRead", "cacheWrite", "output"]
          },
          "ending": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["stream_completed", "stream_error", "consumer_closed"]
          },
          "responseId": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "object",
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "properties": {
                  "status": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "enum": ["unknown"]
                  }
                },
                "required": ["status"]
              },
              {
                "type": "object",
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "properties": {
                  "status": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "enum": ["supported"]
                  },
                  "value": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1,
                    "maxLength": 8192,
                    "pattern": "^(?:[^\\u0000\\uD800-\\uDFFF]|[\\uD800-\\uDBFF][\\uDC00-\\uDFFF])+$"
                  }
                },
                "required": ["status", "value"]
              },
              {
                "type": "object",
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "properties": {
                  "status": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "enum": ["identity_unsupported"]
                  },
                  "reason": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "enum": ["empty", "not_string", "nul", "unpaired_surrogate", "over_bound"]
                  },
                  "correlation": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$"
                  }
                },
                "required": ["status", "reason"]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "required": ["contract", "report", "counts", "ending", "responseId"]
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/components/schemas/ResearchSettlement/properties/evidence",
      "value": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "What the service recorded for a tracked settlement: a bounded disposition and the canonical digest; never the facts or the id.",
        "properties": {
          "disposition": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["accepted", "extended", "subsumed", "conflict", "current", "capped"]
          },
          "replay": {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "capped": {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "digest": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$"
          }
        },
        "required": ["disposition", "replay", "capped", "digest"]
      }
    }
  ]
}
